cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Egyptian Corporate Elite Network, 1932-1950"
abstract: >-
  A person-firm affiliation dataset covering the boards of Egyptian joint-stock
  companies at five points between 1932 and 1950 (1932, 1938, 1942, 1947, 1950),
  machine-extracted from the directors' rosters of Elie I. Politi's Annuaire des
  societes egyptiennes par actions. Records directorships, imputed community of
  origin, Ottoman-Egyptian civil rank, and public office held, with per-wave
  two-mode networks and their projections.
authors:
  - family-names: Hammami
    given-names: Mohamed Dhia
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4498-8770"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-08-27"
# No licence has been selected for this repository yet, so none is asserted
# here. See README section 9 before adding a `license:` field.
repository-code: "https://github.com/MedDhia/EgyptPolitiElites"
url: "https://github.com/MedDhia/EgyptPolitiElites"
keywords:
  - Egypt
  - economic elites
  - interlocking directorates
  - two-mode networks
  - business history
  - Middle East
references:
  - type: book
    title: "Annuaire des societes egyptiennes par actions"
    authors:
      - family-names: Politi
        given-names: Elie I.
    publisher:
      name: "L'Informateur financier et commercial"
    year: 1932
    notes: >-
      The source series. Editions used: 3e (1932), 1938, 1942, 13e (1947),
      and 1950. Provenance and holdings are documented in docs/SOURCES.md.
